   The `table` values in data/key.tsv are Satoshi Tomokiyo's reconstructed table (Cryptiana) rewritten with
   sign names; the rights in that table are his.
   The text of calib/ref_f103v_l1-6.txt comes from Brett Burford's eye reading (CC BY 4.0,
   https://github.com/BravoBravoIX/mayenne-forget-1586-cipher-reading).

These licences do not extend to the content of the historical sources or of other people's work quoted here.

